Package: armatos-session
Version: 2779.1
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: armatos-shell (= 2779.1), mangowm (>= 0.18.6), greetd, swayidle, grim, slurp, wl-clipboard, libnotify-bin, xdg-user-dirs, dbus-user-session, wireplumber, pipewire-pulse, brightnessctl, playerctl, foot, fonts-jetbrains-mono, xdg-desktop-portal-wlr, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk, xwayland
Recommends: thunar, vlc
Maintainer: factionparadox <factionparadox@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Armatos desktop session: MangoWC with the Marmor shell
 Starts MangoWC with the Armatos settings and keybinds, the Marmor shell
 (Titulus, launcher, porta), idle locking, screenshots ("frescoes") and the
 Armatos terminal colours. Your own Mango settings in
 ~/.config/mango/config.conf are read last and win.
